msgid ""
"\"I don't just sell coffee,\" Marcus says with a smile.<br>I provide a reason for people to slow down, look up \n"
"from their phones, and say good morning to their neighbors."
msgstr ""
"\"Bukan hanya jualan kopi,\" kata Marcus sambil tersenyum.<br>Saya juga "
"menyediakan ruang bagi orang-orang \n"
"untuk meluangkan waktu sejenak, berhenti melihat handphone, dan menyapa "
"tetangga."

