#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"<b>7:00 PM – Plaza Doors &amp; Food Trucks Open:</b> Taste local delicacies "
"from seven independent regional food trucks parked along the promenade."
msgstr ""
"<b>19.00 – Pintu Plaza &amp; Food Truck Dibuka:</b> Cicipi hidangan khas "
"lokal dari tujuh food truck regional mandiri yang parkir di sepanjang "
"kawasan pejalan kaki."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"<b>8:00 PM – Live Music:</b> The local folk band <i>The Wandering "
"Strings</i> takes the main wood terrace stage to play an acoustic outdoor "
"set."
msgstr ""
"<b>20.00 – Live Music:</b> Band folk lokal <i>The Wandering Strings</i> akan "
"tampil di panggung teras kayu utama untuk menyuguhkan pertunjukan akustik di "
"luar ruangan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"<b>9:30 PM – The Main Event:</b> Grab your blankets! A spectacular, "
"synchronized pyrotechnic display will light up the sky directly above the "
"modern architecture of City Hall."
msgstr ""
"<b>21.30 – Acara Utama: </b> Siapkan tikar piknik! Pertunjukan kembang api "
"yang spektakuler akan menerangi langit tepat di atas gedung Balai Kota "
"berarsitektur modern ini."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Access infrastructure:</b> A budget of €340,000 was approved to construct"
" a low-impact permeable roadway, complete with dedicated bicycle lanes and "
"underground smart utility lines."
msgstr ""
"<b>Infrastruktur akses:</b> Anggaran sebesar €340.000 telah disetujui untuk "
"membangun jalan berporos rendah yang permeabel, lengkap dengan jalur sepeda "
"khusus dan saluran utilitas cerdas bawah tanah."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Accounting:</b> Manage the municipal budget, automate vendor payments, and produce standardized public\n"
"                financial reports."
msgstr ""
"<b>Akuntansi:</b> Kelola anggaran kota, otomatiskan pembayaran vendor, dan "
"hasilkan laporan keuangan publik\n"
"                yang terstandarisasi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Action Items:</b> If a decision requires action (e.g., \"Repair the park fence\"), the task is assigned to\n"
"                a staff member with a specific deadline."
msgstr ""
"<b>Item Tindakan:</b> Jika suatu keputusan memerlukan tindakan (misalnya "
"\"Perbaikan pagar taman\"), tugas tersebut diberikan kepada\n"
"                anggota staf dengan tenggat tertentu."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Activity Tracking:</b> Managers use internal notes and scheduled activities within the ticket to ensure\n"
"                deadlines for public safety issues are met."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pelacakan Aktivitas:</b> Manajer menggunakan catatan internal dan "
"aktivitas terjadwal dalam tiket untuk memastikan\n"
"                batas waktu terkait masalah keamanan publik terpenuhi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Appointment Types:</b> Configure specific durations for different needs, such as \"ID Renewal (15 mins)\"\n"
"                or \"Urban Planning Consultation (45 mins).\""
msgstr ""
"<b>Tipe Appointment:</b> Atur durasi spesifik untuk kebutuhan yang berbeda, "
"seperti \"Perpanjangan ID (15 menit)\"\n"
"                atau \"Konsultasi Perencanaan Kota (45 menit).\""

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Appointments:</b> Provides a 24/7 self-service portal for citizens to book meetings with officials or\n"
"                schedule document renewals."
msgstr ""
"<b>Appointment:</b> Menyediakan portal layanan mandiri 24 jam bagi warga "
"untuk membuat janji temu dengan pejabat atau\n"
"                menjadwalkan pembaruan dokumen."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Arrival:</b> The plaza opens at 7:00 PM for food and music; fireworks "
"begin promptly at 9:30 PM."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kedatangan:</b> Alun-alun dibuka pukul 19.00 dengan sajian hidangan dan "
"musik; pertunjukan kembang api dimulai tepat pukul 21.30."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Audience:</b> All registered municipal voters. First-time voters are "
"especially encouraged to attend!"
msgstr ""
"<b>Audiens:</b> Semua pemilih terdaftar di tingkat kota. Pemilih pemula "
"sangat dianjurkan untuk hadir!"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>Audience:</b> Engaged residents, local business owners, and anyone "
"curious about municipal governance."
msgstr ""
"<b>Audiens:</b> Warga yang aktif, pemilik usaha lokal, dan siapa pun yang "
"tertarik dengan tata kelola pemerintahan kota."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Audience:</b> Open to everyone! Families, children, and residents of all "
"ages."
msgstr ""
"<b>Audiens:</b> Terbuka untuk semua orang! Keluarga, anak-anak, dan penduduk "
"dari segala usia."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automatic Archiving:</b> Once fully signed, the document is automatically stored in the\n"
"                <b>Documents</b> app and visible in the <b>Citizen Portal</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Arsip Otomatis:</b> Setelah ditandatangani oleh semua pihak, dokumen "
"otomatis disimpan di\n"
"                aplikasi <b>Dokumen</b> dan dapat dilihat di <b>Portal "
"Warga</b>."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Blog posts:</b> Publish official statements on municipal projects, emergency alerts (like weather\n"
"                warnings), or highlights from community events."
msgstr ""
"<b>Postingan blog:</b> Publikasikan pernyataan resmi mengenai proyek-proyek "
"kota, peringatan darurat (seperti\n"
"                peringatan cuaca), atau sorotan dari acara-acara komunitas."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Blog:</b> Publishes official news, emergency alerts, and community stories to keep the public\n"
"                well-informed."
msgstr ""
"<b>Blog:</b> Menerbitkan berita resmi, peringatan darurat, dan kisah-kisah "
"yang terjadi di masyarakat agar publik\n"
"                tetap mendapat informasi yang memadai."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Capacity:</b> 180 seated guests / 250 standing for cocktail receptions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kapasitas:</b> 180 tamu duduk / 250 tamu berdiri untuk pesta koktail."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid "<b>Capacity:</b> 350+ people (Flexible open-air layout)."
msgstr "<b>Kapasitas:</b> 350+ orang (layout udara terbuka fleksibel)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid "<b>Capacity:</b> Up to 30 people (Boardroom or Classroom style)"
msgstr "<b>Kapasitas:</b> Maks. 30 orang (bergaya ruang rapat atau ruang kelas)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralize Communication:</b> Discourage staff from using personal emails for official business. All\n"
"                communication should happen inside the <b>Odoo Chatter</b> to ensure continuity if a staff member is absent."
msgstr ""
"<b>Sentralisasi Komunikasi:</b> Hindari penggunaan email pribadi staf untuk "
"urusan resmi. Semua\n"
"                komunikasi harus dilakukan di <b>Odoo Chatter</b> agar "
"komunikasi tetap lancar meski staf tidak hadir."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Chatter &amp; Notifications:</b> As the ticket status changes from \"In Progress\" to \"Resolved,\" the citizen\n"
"                receives automated email updates, building trust in public services."
msgstr ""
"<b>Chatter &amp; Notifikasi:</b> Saat status tiket berubah dari \"Diproses\" "
"menjadi \"Diselesaikan,\" warga\n"
"                menerima notifikasi email otomatis, yang nantinya akan "
"membangun kepercayaan terhadap layanan publik."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Citizen action item:</b> We believe transparent governance requires "
"active collaboration. The Council invites all direct neighbors to review the"
" infrastructure timelines and voice any environmental inquiries."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tindakan warga:</b> Kami percaya bahwa tata kelola yang transparan "
"membutuhkan kolaborasi aktif. Dewan mengundang semua tetangga langsung untuk "
"meninjau jadwal pembangunan infrastruktur dan menyampaikan pertanyaan apa "
"pun terkait lingkungan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Communication History:</b> The portal tracks all official messages exchanged with the city hall, creating\n"
"                a reliable audit trail for both parties."
msgstr ""
"<b>Riwayat Komunikasi:</b> Portal ini melacak semua pesan resmi dengan balai "
"kota, menciptakan\n"
"                jejak audit yang dapat diandalkan bagi kedua belah pihak."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Community Culture &amp; Safety</b>"
msgstr "<b>Budaya &amp; Keselamatan Warga</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Conflict Management:</b> The system ensures that no two community groups can book the same town hall or\n"
"                tennis court at the same time."
msgstr ""
"<b>Manajemen Konflik:</b> Sistem ini memastikan bahwa tidak ada dua kelompok "
"yang dapat memesan balai kota atau\n"
"                lapangan tenis yang sama pada waktu yang bersamaan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Details:</b> Polling is open from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM. High-visibility "
"signage and \"Civic Ambassadors\" will be on-site to help guide you through "
"the process. Let's make our turnout the highest yet!"
msgstr ""
"<b>Detail:</b> Pemungutan suara dibuka mulai pukul 09.00 hingga 17.00. Papan "
"petunjuk yang mencolok dan \"Duta Warga\" akan hadir di lokasi untuk "
"membantu memandu Anda melalui proses ini. Mari kita jadikan partisipasi kita "
"kali ini yang tertinggi sepanjang sejarah!"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Details:</b> We’ll have local food trucks and live music on the terrace. "
"Bring your own picnic blankets or lawn chairs. For the safety of all, please"
" leave pets at home as the display can be loud."
msgstr ""
"<b>Detail:</b> Kami akan menghadirkan food truck lokal dan pertunjukan musik "
"live di teras. Bawalah tikar piknik atau kursi taman sendiri. Demi "
"keselamatan semua orang, harap tinggalkan hewan peliharaan di rumah karena "
"pertunjukan ini mungkin berisik."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Digital Transformation</b>"
msgstr "<b>Transformasi Digital</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Document Access:</b> All signed permits, tax documents, or rental agreements are stored securely and\n"
"                remain accessible for download at any time."
msgstr ""
"<b>Akses Dokumen:</b> Semua izin, dokumen pajak, atau perjanjian sewa-"
"menyewa yang bertanda tangan disimpan\n"
"                 dengan aman dan dapat diunduh kapan saja."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Document Templates:</b> Store standard forms for building permits, parking stickers, or community\n"
"                petitions as reusable digital templates."
msgstr ""
"<b>Template Dokumen:</b> Simpan formulir standar untuk izin bangunan, stiker "
"parkir, atau\n"
"                petisi sebagai template digital yang dapat digunakan ulang."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Eco-friendly guidelines:</b> The Council mandated that all new homes "
"built within this perimeter must adhere to modern bioclimatic standards, "
"utilizing sustainable timber framing and rainwater harvesting systems."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pedoman ramah lingkungan:</b> Dewan mewajibkan semua rumah baru yang "
"dibangun di dalam wilayah ini harus mematuhi standar bioklimatik modern, "
"dengan memanfaatkan rangka kayu berkelanjutan dan sistem penampungan air "
"hujan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Employees:</b> Maintain a secure directory of city hall staff, tracking their certifications, training,\n"
"                and departmental assignments."
msgstr ""
"<b>Karyawan:</b> Secara aman menyimpan direktori untuk staf balai kota, "
"melacak sertifikasi, pelatihan,\n"
"                dan penugasan departemen."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Entry:</b> Free of charge (please register via the \"Get Tickets\" button"
" to help us manage capacity)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pendaftaran:</b> Gratis (silakan daftar lewat tombol \"Dapatkan Tiket\" "
"untuk membantu kami mengatur kapasitas)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Events Management:</b> Create pages for the annual summer fair or town hall meetings. Citizens can\n"
"                register for free or paid tickets, allowing you to track expected attendance."
msgstr ""
"<b>Manajemen Acara:</b> Buat halaman untuk pameran musim panas tahunan atau "
"rapat umum. Warga dapat\n"
"                mendaftar untuk tiket gratis atau berbayar, dan Anda dapat "
"melacak perkiraan jumlah peserta."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Events:</b> Organizes, promotes, and tracks attendance for local fairs, town halls, and community\n"
"                workshops."
msgstr ""
"<b>Acara:</b> Mengadakan, mempromosikan, dan melacak kehadiran di pameran "
"lokal, pertemuan warga, dan\n"
"                lokakarya komunitas."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Fairplay Avenue:</b> 18%"
msgstr "<b>Fairplay Avenue:</b> 18%"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"<b>Flawless Acoustics:</b> The venue boasts hidden acoustic ceiling panels, "
"ensuring that whether a string quartet or a live folk band is playing on the"
" raised wooden stage, the sound is crisp, warm, and clear."
msgstr ""
"<b>Akustik Sempurna:</b> Tempat ini dilengkapi panel langit-langit akustik "
"tersembunyi, yang memastikan bahwa suara string quartet, band folk, atau "
"siapa pun yang tampil di atas panggung kayu tetap jernih, hangat, dan jelas."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"<b>Flexible Layouts:</b> From a seated dinner banquet for 180 guests to an "
"elegant standing cocktail reception for 250, our facility managers customize"
" the floor plan to fit your exact creative vision."
msgstr ""
"<b>Layout Fleksibel:</b> Mulai dari jamuan makan malam dengan tempat duduk "
"untuk 180 tamu hingga resepsi standing cocktail yang elegan untuk 250 tamu, "
"manajer fasilitas kami akan menyesuaikan denah lantai agar sesuai dengan "
"visi kreatif Anda."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Founder’s Lane:</b> 12%"
msgstr "<b>Founder’s Lane:</b> 12%"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Green Infrastructure</b>"
msgstr "<b>Infrastruktur Hijau</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Helpdesk Integration:</b> Citizens can view the live status of their submitted tickets (e.g., \"Pothole\n"
"                repair scheduled for Tuesday\") without having to call the front desk."
msgstr ""
"<b>Integrasi Helpdesk:</b> Warga dapat melihat status terkini dari tiket "
"yang diajukan (misalnya \"Perbaikan lubang jalan\n"
"                dijadwalkan hari Selasa\") tanpa harus menelepon meja "
"layanan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Helpdesk:</b> The submission automatically generates a ticket. Staff can categorize the request by\n"
"                department and assign it to the relevant maintenance team."
msgstr ""
"<b>Helpdesk:</b> Penguajuan secara otomatis menghasilkan tiket. Staf dapat "
"mengategorikan permohonan berdasarkan\n"
"                departemen dan menugaskannya kepada tim maintenance yang "
"relevan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Helpdesk:</b> Tracks citizen inquiries, pothole reports, and complaints from initial submission through\n"
"                to final administrative resolution."
msgstr ""
"<b>Helpdesk:</b> Melacak pertanyaan warga, laporan lubang jalan, dan keluhan "
"mulai dari pengajuan awal hingga\n"
"                penyelesaian administratif akhir."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Ideal For:</b> Board meetings, strategic planning sessions, HOA/POA "
"assemblies, educational workshops, and small-scale seminars."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cocok untuk:</b>Rapat dewan, sesi perencanaan strategis, rapat HOA/POA, "
"lokakarya pendidikan, dan seminar kecil."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Ideal For:</b> School garden fétes, fundraiser lotteries, farmers' "
"markets, outdoor concerts, yoga in the park, and community family days."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cocok untuk:</b>Pesta kebun sekolah, undian penggalangan dana, pasar "
"tani, konser luar ruangan, yoga taman, dan rekreasi keluarga masyarakat."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Ideal For:</b> Weddings, community banquets, corporate award ceremonies, "
"cultural performances, and non-profit fundraisers."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cocok untuk:</b> Pernikahan, jamuan komunitas, upacara penghargaan "
"perusahaan, pertunjukan budaya, dan penggalangan dana nirlaba."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Internal Approvals:</b> Use the same tool for the Mayor or Council to sign off on budgets and official\n"
"                decrees without passing physical folders around the office."
msgstr ""
"<b>Persetujuan Internal:</b> Gunakan alat yang sama agar Walikota atau Dewan "
"dapat memberikan tanda tangan pada anggaran dan\n"
"                peraturan resmi tanpa perlu repot berkas fisik di kantor."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Invoicing:</b> For paid rentals, Odoo generates an invoice automatically, which can be paid online via\n"
"                the citizen portal using integrated payment providers."
msgstr ""
"<b>Faktur:</b> Untuk sewa berbayar, Odoo otomatis membuatkan faktur, yang "
"dapat dibayar secara online melalui\n"
"                portal warga menggunakan penyedia pembayaran terintegrasi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Key Features:</b> Integrated AV system with 4K display, high-speed "
"municipal Wi-Fi, climate control, and ergonomic seating."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitur Utama:</b> Sistem AV terintegrasi dengan layar 4K, Wi-Fi kota "
"berkecepatan tinggi, pengatur suhu, dan tempat duduk ergonomis."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Key Features:</b> Outdoor power outlets for PA systems, accessible paved "
"pathways, night-time bistro lighting, and integrated bench seating."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitur Utama:</b> Stopkontak luar ruangan untuk sistem pengeras suara, "
"jalur beraspal yang mudah diakses, pencahayaan bistro malam hari, dan tempat "
"duduk bangku terintegrasi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Key Features:</b> Professional acoustic treatment, dedicated stage area "
"for bands or speakers, adjustable ambient lighting, and direct access to a "
"commercial-grade catering prep kitchen."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitur Utama:</b> Fasilitas pendukung akustik profesional, area panggung "
"khusus untuk band atau pembicara, pencahayaan ambient yang dapat "
"disesuaikan, dan akses langsung ke dapur persiapan katering berstandar "
"komersial."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>Location:</b> City Hall Meeting Room (Second Floor) or join via the live "
"stream link in your Citizen Portal."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lokasi:</b> Ruang Rapat Balai Kota (Lantai Dua) atau ikuti melalui tautan "
"siaran langsung di Portal Warga."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Marketing &amp; Newsletter:</b> Use the registered emails from events and surveys to send official monthly\n"
"                city newsletters via the <b>Email Marketing</b> app."
msgstr ""
"<b>Marketing &amp; Surat Kabar:</b> Gunakan alamat email terdaftar dari "
"acara dan survei untuk mengirimkan buletin bulanan resmi\n"
"                kota melalui aplikasi <b>Email Marketing</b>."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Meadowview Drive:</b> 28%"
msgstr "<b>Meadowview Drive:</b> 28%"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Meeting Minutes:</b> Use the task description or the <b>Notes</b> app to record the debate and the final\n"
"                vote for each item during the session."
msgstr ""
"<b>Notulen Rapat:</b> Gunakan deskripsi tugas atau aplikasi <b>Catatan</b> "
"untuk mencatat debat dan\n"
"                pemungutan suara akhir untuk setiap poin selama sesi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid "<b>Modalities:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Modalitas:</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Odoo Sign:</b> Send a signature request via email. The citizen signs on their smartphone or computer, and\n"
"                the system records the IP address and timestamp for legal validity."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odoo Sign:</b> Kirim permintaan tanda tangan melalui email. Warga tanda "
"tangan elwat ponsel atau komputer, dan\n"
"                sistem mencatat alamat IP serta cap waktu untuk keabsahan "
"hukum."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Olympia Way:</b> 42% (The Winning Choice!)"
msgstr "<b>Olympia Way:</b> 42% (Pilihan Pemenang!)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Online Booking:</b> Citizens choose their preferred date and time from the website, receiving an instant\n"
"                confirmation and a calendar invite."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pemesanan Online:</b> Warga memilih tanggal dan waktu yang diinginkan "
"dari website, serta menerima\n"
"                konfirmasi instan dan undangan kalender."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Payroll:</b> Ensure compliant and timely salary processing for all public servants, from the central\n"
"                administration to the public works crew."
msgstr ""
"<b>Payroll:</b> Pastikan pemrosesan gaji yang sesuai dan tepat waktu bagi "
"semua pegawai negeri, mulai dari\n"
"                pemerintahan pusat hingga petugas pekerjaan umum."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Process:</b> Check-in at the front desk, then choose your preferred "
"voting method (private paper booth or digital kiosk)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Proses:</b> Lakukan check-in di resepsionis, lalu pilih metode pemungutan "
"suara yang diinginkan (bilik kertas pribadi atau kiosk digital)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project Management:</b> Create a project for \"City Council 2024.\" Each agenda item for an upcoming\n"
"                meeting is entered as a task."
msgstr ""
"<b>Manajemen Proyek:</b> Buat proyek untuk \"Dewan Kota 2024.\" Setiap poin "
"agenda untuk\n"
"                rapat mendatang dimasukkan sebagai tugas."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project Visibility:</b> Selected city projects can be shared in the portal to show the community the\n"
"                progress of major infrastructure works."
msgstr ""
"<b>Visibilitas Proyek:</b> Proyek-proyek kota terpilih dapat dibagikan di "
"portal untuk menunjukkan\n"
"                kemajuan pekerjaan infrastruktur utama kepada masyarakat."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project:</b> Structures council agendas and tracks administrative tasks to ensure accountability across\n"
"                all municipal departments."
msgstr ""
"<b>Project:</b> Menyusun agenda dewan dan memantau tugas-tugas administratif "
"untuk memastikan akuntabilitas di\n"
"                seluruh departemen kota."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>Public Comment:</b> The first 30 minutes are dedicated to \"Floor Time\" "
"where residents can speak for 3 minutes on any agenda item."
msgstr ""
"<b>Komentar Publik:</b> 30 menit pertama didedikasikan untuk \"Dengar "
"Pendapat\" di mana warga dapat berbicara selama 3 menit mengenai poin agenda "
"apa pun."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Public Surveys:</b> Use the <b>Survey</b> app to poll residents on new projects (e.g., \"What should be\n"
"                the priority for the new park?\")."
msgstr ""
"<b>Survei Publik:</b> Gunakan aplikasi <b>Survei</b> untuk melakukan jajak "
"pendapat warga mengenai proyek-proyek baru\n"
"                (misalnya \"Apa saja yang harus diprioritaskan di taman baru "
"ini?\")."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Public Works &amp; Roads</b>"
msgstr "<b>Proyek &amp; Jalan Publik</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Public consultation:</b> The official public inquiry phase is now open. "
"Residents can review the full scale-model architectural blueprints on "
"display in the City Hall lobby."
msgstr ""
"<b>Konsultasi publik:</b> Tahap konsultasi publik resmi kini telah dibuka. "
"Warga dapat melihat denah arsitektur berskala penuh yang dipajang di lobi "
"Balai Kota."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Ready to transform your community management?</b>"
msgstr "<b>Siap mentransformasi manajemen komunitas Anda?</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reminders:</b> Automated SMS or email reminders are sent 24 hours before the meeting, significantly\n"
"                reducing missed appointments."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pengingat:</b> Pengingat otomatis melalui SMS atau email dikirim 24 jam "
"sebelum rapat, secara signifikan\n"
"                mengurangi jumlah appointment yang terlewat."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Rental Agreement:</b> Link the booking to <b>Odoo Sign</b> to ensure the citizen accepts the terms of use\n"
"                and liability before the reservation is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"<b>Perjanjian Sewa-Menyewa:</b> Hubungkan pemesanan ke <b>Odoo Sign</b> "
"untuk memastikan warga menyetujui syarat penggunaan\n"
"                dan tanggung jawab sebelum reservasi dikonfirmasi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Rental:</b> Manages the availability and payment for community halls, sports fields, and public\n"
"                equipment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Rental:</b> Mengelola ketersediaan dan pembayaran untuk gedung komunitas, "
"lapangan olahraga, dan\n"
"                peralatan umum."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Requirements:</b> Please bring a valid photo ID and your voter "
"registration card (digital or physical)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Persyaratan:</b> Bawa kartu identitas berfoto yang masih berlaku dan "
"kartu pendaftaran pemilih Anda (digital atau fisik)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Resource Catalog:</b> List all available assets on the website with high-quality photos, capacity limits,\n"
"                and clear pricing rules."
msgstr ""
"<b>Katalog Sumber Daya:</b> Cantumkan semua aset yang tersedia di website "
"dengan foto berkualitas tinggi, batas kapasitas,\n"
"                dan aturan penetapan harga yang jelas."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Results Transparency:</b> Share the anonymized results of community polls on the website to show how\n"
"                public opinion influenced a final decision."
msgstr ""
"<b>Transparansi Hasil:</b> Bagikan hasil jajak pendapat komunitas anonim di "
"website untuk menunjukkan pengaruh\n"
"                opini publik terhadap keputusan akhir."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"<b>Seamless Catering Integration:</b> The hall features direct, hidden "
"service access to a commercial-grade preparation kitchen, allowing your "
"chosen catering team to serve guests seamlessly without disrupting the "
"aesthetics of the room."
msgstr ""
"<b>Integrasi Katering Mulus:</b> Aula ini dilengkapi akses layanan langsung "
"yang tersembunyi ke dapur persiapan berstandar komersial, sehingga tim "
"katering pilihan Anda dapat melayani tamu dengan lancar tanpa mengganggu "
"estetika ruangan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Searchable archives:</b> Residents can easily find past announcements regarding tax changes, zoning laws,\n"
"                or historical meeting minutes."
msgstr ""
"<b>Arsip yang dapat dicari:</b> Warga dapat mengakses kembali pengumuman "
"tentang perubahan pajak, peraturan zonasi,\n"
"                atau notula rapat historis."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sign:</b> Facilitates legal digital signatures for permits, petitions, and internal approvals,\n"
"                eliminating the need for physical paperwork."
msgstr ""
"<b>Sign:</b> Memfasilitasi tanda tangan digital yang sah untuk izin, petisi, "
"dan persetujuan internal,\n"
"                sehingga dokumen fisik tak lagi diperlukan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Social sharing:</b> Link your blog posts to social media channels to ensure the message reaches residents\n"
"                wherever they are online."
msgstr ""
"<b>Publikasi media sosial:</b> Hubungkan postingan blog dengan saluran media "
"sosial untuk memastikan pesan tersebut menjangkau warga\n"
"                di mana pun mereka berada saat online."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Staff Calendar:</b> The official's Odoo calendar is automatically updated, preventing double-bookings and\n"
"                allowing for better preparation."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kalender Staf:</b> Kalender Odoo petugas tersebut diperbarui secara "
"otomatis, mencegah pemesanan ganda dan\n"
"                memungkinkan persiapan yang lebih baik."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardize Your Templates:</b> Build clean templates for your most common permits in <b>Odoo Sign</b>.\n"
"                This ensures legal consistency and professional municipal branding."
msgstr ""
"<b>Standardisasi Template:</b> Buat template yang rapi untuk izin-izin yang "
"paling umum di <b>Odoo Sign</b>.\n"
"                Hal ini memastikan konsistensi hukum dan pencitraan "
"pemerintah kota yang profesional."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid "<b>Surface Area:</b> 1,200 m² (13,000 sq. ft.)"
msgstr "<b>Luas Lahan:</b> 1.200 m² (13.000 kaki persegi)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid "<b>Surface Area:</b> 280 m² (3,000 sq. ft.)"
msgstr "<b>Luas Lahan:</b> 280 m² (3.000 kaki persegi)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid "<b>Surface Area:</b> 65 m² (700 sq. ft.)"
msgstr "<b>Luas Lahan:</b> 65 m² (700 kaki persegi)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Survey:</b> Gathers community feedback on public initiatives, urban planning, and local service\n"
"                satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"<b>Survei:</b> Mengumpulkan masukan dari masyarakat mengenai inisiatif "
"publik, perencanaan kota, dan\n"
"                 kepuasan terhadap layanan lokal."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>The Details:</b> The full agenda is available for download on the "
"<b>Citizen Portal</b> 48 hours before the meeting. Come early to grab a "
"coffee and meet your representatives informally before the session begins."
msgstr ""
"<b>Detail:</b> Agenda lengkap dapat diunduh di <b>Portal Warga</b> 48 jam "
"sebelum rapat. Datanglah lebih awal untuk menikmati secangkir kopi dan "
"bertemu dengan perwakilan secara santai sebelum sesi dimulai."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>The Portal-First Strategy:</b> Encourage citizens to use the portal for all requests. This reduces phone\n"
"                interruptions and creates a permanent record of all interactions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Strategi Mengutamakan Portal:</b> Dukung warga menggunakan portal untuk "
"semua permohonan. Hal ini mengurangi\n"
"                gangguan telepon dan membuat catatan permanen dari semua "
"interaksi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timeline View:</b> Use the Gantt or Kanban views to see how many council directives are currently being\n"
"                processed by the administration."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tampilan Timeline:</b> Gunakan tampilan Gantt atau Kanban untuk melihat "
"berapa banyak arahan dewan yang saat ini\n"
"                sedang diproses oleh administrasi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Transparency:</b> Regularly post the minutes of council meetings and financial reports for public\n"
"                scrutiny to ensure accountability."
msgstr ""
"<b>Transparansi:</b> Secara rutin memublikasikan notula rapat dewan dan "
"laporan keuangan untuk\n"
"                pemeriksaan publik guna memastikan akuntabilitas."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Website:</b> Acts as the digital town square where residents find information, services, and official\n"
"                updates."
msgstr ""
"<b>Website:</b> Berfungsi sebagai alun-alun digital tempat warga mencari "
"informasi, layanan, dan\n"
"                informasi resmi."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Website:</b> The resident accesses a simple reporting form on the municipal site, providing details and\n"
"                photos of the issue (e.g., a broken streetlight or missed trash collection)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Website:</b> Warga dapat mengakses formulir pelaporan sederhana di situs "
"pemerintah kota, memberikan detail dan\n"
"                foto terkait masalah tersebut (misalnya lampu jalan rusak "
"atau pengumpulan sampah yang terlewat)."

#. module: public_institution
