"celebrate our local athletic spirit and proximity to the sports park, the "
"Council has officially signed the naming decree. Our public works department"
" has already ordered the new high-visibility signage, which will be "
"installed as soon as the first road layer is paved next month."
msgstr ""
"Karena <b>Olympia Way</b> sangat selaras dengan keinginan Anda untuk "
"merayakan semangat atletik lokal dan kedekatan kami dengan taman olahraga, "
"Dewan telah secara resmi menandatangani keputusan penamaan tersebut. "
"Departemen pekerjaan umum telah memesan papan nama baru yang mudah terlihat, "
"yang akan dipasang segera setelah lapisan jalan pertama diaspal bulan depan."

