msgid ""
"By integrating every aspect of municipal management, from citizen requests and public hall rentals to council\n"
"        meeting organization, Odoo empowers public servants to focus on high-value community initiatives. This guide\n"
"        provides a roadmap for implementing a \"Digital City Hall\" that fosters transparency, accessibility, and operational\n"
"        efficiency across all departments."
msgstr ""
"Dengan mengintegrasikan setiap aspek pengelolaan kota, mulai dari permintaan "
"warga dan penyewaan ruang publik hingga\n"
"        pengadaan rapat dewan, Odoo memberdayakan pegawai negeri untuk fokus "
"pada inisiatif masyarakat bernilai tinggi. Panduan ini\n"
"        menyediakan alur untuk menerapkan \"Balai Kota Digital\" yang "
"mendorong transparansi, aksesibilitas, dan efisiensi operasional\n"
"        di seluruh departemen."

