#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_7
msgid ""
"If you walk past the sun-drenched front plaza of City Hall on any given "
"morning, you are bound to notice a rich, comforting aroma drifting through "
"the air. That smell belongs to <i>The Civic Espresso</i>, an independent "
"mobile coffee triporteur run by local resident and passionate barista, "
"Marcus Vance. It has quickly become the social heart of our neighborhood’s "
"morning routine."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda berjalan melewati alun-alun depan Balai Kota yang bermandikan "
"sinar matahari pada suatu pagi, Anda pasti akan mencium aroma semerbak dan "
"menenangkan yang menyebar di udara. Aroma itu berasal dari <i>The Civic "
"Espresso</i>, penjual kopi keliling yang dijalankan oleh penduduk setempat "
"sekaligus barista yang bersemangat, Marcus Vance. Gerobak ini langsung "
"menjadi pusat kegiatan sosial dalam rutinitas pagi lingkungan kami."

