msgid ""
"Marcus’s cart represents exactly what our modern City Hall plaza was built "
"for: fostering spontaneous human connection. On any given day, you will find"
" municipal clerks, construction workers, local business owners, and parents "
"fresh from the school run standing together by the wooden steps, chatting "
"over fresh pastries and lattes."
msgstr ""
"Kopi Keliling Marcus merupakan representasi dari tujuan dibangunnya alun-"
"alun Balai Kota: menumbuhkan hubungan antarmanusia yang spontan. Setiap "
"hari, Anda akan menjumpai pegawai pemerintah kota, pekerja konstruksi, "
"pemilik usaha lokal, dan orang tua yang baru saja mengantar anak ke sekolah "
"berdiri bersama di dekat tangga kayu, mengobrol sambil menikmati kue-kue "
"segar dan latte."

