msgid "Olympia Way (celebrating our proximity to the sports field)"
msgstr "Olympia Way (merayakan kedekatan dengan lapangan olahraga)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:helpdesk.team,description:public_institution.helpdesk_team_1
msgid ""
"Our <strong>Citizen Helpdesk</strong> is your 24/7 portal to report non-"
"emergency issues and request municipal services without the need for a phone"
" call or an office visit. <br>Whether it’s a flickering streetlight, a "
"missed waste collection, or a suggestion for our parks, your voice is now "
"trackable and transparent."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pusat Bantuan Warga</strong> adalah portal 24/7 untuk melaporkan "
"masalah non-darurat dan mengajukan permohonan layanan kota tanpa perlu "
"menelepon atau datang ke kantor. <br>Baik itu lampu jalan yang berkedip, "
"pengumpulan sampah yang terlewat, atau saran untuk taman, suara Anda kini "
"dapat dilacak dan transparan."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid ""
"Our agency specializes in providing essential services, resources, and "
"support to the community, ensuring that all citizens have access to the help"
" they need to thrive."
msgstr ""
"Spesialisasi lembaga kami adalah menyediakan layanan, sumber daya, dan "
"dukungan penting bagi masyarakat, memastikan semua warga memiliki akses ke "
"bantuan yang mereka butuhkan untuk mencapai kemakmuran."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid ""
"Our most notable investment this quarter is the operational integration of "
"the new City Hall’s living green roof. This installation naturally regulates"
" the building's temperature, slashing municipal energy costs by 22% while "
"filtering rainwater runoff. Furthermore, by transitioning 85% of our "
"internal permitting procedures to digital workflows, we have successfully "
"saved over three tons of administrative paper to date."
msgstr ""
"Investasi paling menonjol pada kuartal ini adalah integrasi operasional atap "
"hijau hidup di Balai Kota yang baru. Instalasi ini secara alami mengatur "
"suhu bangunan, sehingga memangkas biaya energi kota sebesar 22% sekaligus "
"menyaring limpasan air hujan. Selain itu, dengan mengalihkan 85% dari "
"prosedur perizinan internal kami ke alur kerja digital, kami berhasil "
"menghemat lebih dari tiga ton kertas administrasi hingga saat ini."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3833
msgid "Our payment methods"
msgstr "Metode pembayarankami"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid ""
"Our services include social support, educational programs, and community "
"development initiatives. We strive to provide valuable resources to all "
"residents."
msgstr ""
"Layanan kami meliputi dukungan sosial, program pendidikan, dan inisiatif "
